{"unit":{"id":"l1-u38","level":1,"order":38,"title":"Past & Change","wordIds":["w:了","w:过","w:没","w:没有","w:着","w:正在","w:正","w:得到","w:准备","w:一下儿","w:有一些","w:有时候"],"grammarIds":["g:meiyou-negation","g:zhengzai-progressive","g:jieguo-complement","g:banian-halfunit","g:yixiar-brief-verb","g:tai-le"],"sentenceIds":["s:l1:021","s:l1:022","s:l1:024","s:l1:039","s:l1:052","s:l1:127","s:l1:068","s:l3:226","s:l1:085","s:l1:087","s:l1:088","s:l1:106","s:l1:107","s:l3:236","s:l1:125","s:l1:126","s:l1:137","s:l3:222","s:l1:170","s:l1:215","s:l2:338","s:l1:210","s:l1:211","s:l1:217","s:l1:090","s:l1:206","s:l1:086","s:l1:038","s:l1:148","s:l1:203","s:l3:220","s:l1:037","s:l1:023","s:l1:040","s:l1:065","s:l1:131","s:l1:227","s:l1:147","s:l3:135","s:l2:339"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:meiyou-negation","title":"没 for negating past actions","pattern":"没 + verb","explanation":"没 (méi) says an action didn't happen, which is different from 不, which negates general facts or habits. 我没去 means \"I didn't go\", not \"I don't go\". 没 is a short form of 没有 in this use.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:021","s:l1:022","s:l1:023","s:l1:024"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"g:zhengzai-progressive","title":"正在 for actions in progress","pattern":"正在 + verb","explanation":"正在 (zhèngzài) marks an action happening right now, like English \"-ing\". Put it directly before the verb: 我正在看 (\"I'm looking right now\"). It's often shortened to just 正 or just 在 in casual speech, but 正在 is the clearest form for beginners.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:085","s:l1:086","s:l1:087","s:l1:088"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"g:jieguo-complement","title":"Resultative complements with 到 and 见","pattern":"verb + 到 / 见","explanation":"Adding 到 (dào) or 见 (jiàn) right after a verb shows the action succeeded, not just that it was attempted: 找到 (\"found\", not just \"looked for\"), 看见 (\"saw\", not just \"looked at\"), 听到 (\"heard\"), 回到 (\"made it back to\"). Without the complement, 看 and 听 only describe the effort, not the outcome.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:124","s:l1:125","s:l1:126","s:l1:127"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"g:banian-halfunit","title":"半天 and 半年 for stretches of time","pattern":"半 + time word (天/年)","explanation":"半 (\"half\") combines with time words to describe a duration: 半天 (\"half a day\", often used loosely to mean \"a long while\"), 半年 (\"half a year\"). Place the resulting phrase where any duration or time word would go.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:216","s:l1:217","s:l1:218"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"g:yixiar-brief-verb","title":"verb + 一下儿 for a quick action","pattern":"verb + 一下(儿)","explanation":"Adding 一下儿 (yíxiàr) right after a verb makes the action sound brief, casual, or low-pressure — similar to \"just a second\" in English: 看一下儿 (\"take a quick look\"), 等一下儿 (\"wait a moment\"). It softens requests, making them sound more polite.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:210","s:l1:211","s:l1:212"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"g:tai-le","title":"太...了 for \"too much\"","pattern":"太 + adjective + 了","explanation":"太 (tài) means \"too\" or \"extremely\", and adding a sentence-final 了 emphasizes the degree. 太好了! is a common exclamation meaning \"Great!\" or \"That's wonderful!\", not a literal complaint.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:037","s:l1:038","s:l1:039","s:l1:040"],"unitId":"l1-u38"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l1:021","zh":"我没去。","pinyin":"Wǒ méi qù.","en":"I didn't go.","wordIds":["w:我","w:没","w:去"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:022","zh":"他没看。","pinyin":"Tā méi kàn.","en":"He didn't look.","wordIds":["w:他","w:没","w:看"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:024","zh":"你没来。","pinyin":"Nǐ méi lái.","en":"You didn't come.","wordIds":["w:你","w:没","w:来"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:039","zh":"你太好了。","pinyin":"Nǐ tài hǎo le.","en":"You're too kind.","wordIds":["w:你","w:太","w:好","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:052","zh":"你怎么了？","pinyin":"Nǐ zěnme le?","en":"What's wrong with you?","wordIds":["w:你","w:怎么","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:127","zh":"我找到了。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhǎodào le.","en":"I found it.","wordIds":["w:我","w:找到","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:068","zh":"你别想了。","pinyin":"Nǐ bié xiǎng le.","en":"Stop thinking about it.","wordIds":["w:你","w:别","w:想","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l3:226","zh":"我没有他高。","pinyin":"Wǒ méiyǒu tā gāo.","en":"I'm not as tall as him.","wordIds":["w:我","w:没有","w:他","w:高"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:085","zh":"我正在看。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhèngzài kàn.","en":"I'm looking right now.","wordIds":["w:我","w:正在","w:看"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:087","zh":"你正在做什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhèngzài zuò shénme?","en":"What are you doing right now?","wordIds":["w:你","w:正在","w:做","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:088","zh":"她正在说。","pinyin":"Tā zhèngzài shuō.","en":"She's speaking right now.","wordIds":["w:她","w:正在","w:说"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:106","zh":"他真的来了。","pinyin":"Tā zhēnde lái le.","en":"He really came.","wordIds":["w:他","w:真的","w:来","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:107","zh":"我真的没去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhēnde méi qù.","en":"I really didn't go.","wordIds":["w:我","w:真的","w:没","w:去"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l3:236","zh":"我一看就明白了。","pinyin":"Wǒ yī kàn jiù míngbai le.","en":"As soon as I saw it, I understood.","wordIds":["w:我","w:一","w:看","w:就","w:明白","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:125","zh":"你听到了吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ tīngdào le ma?","en":"Did you hear it?","wordIds":["w:你","w:听到","w:了","w:吗"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:126","zh":"他回到家里了。","pinyin":"Tā huídào jiālǐ le.","en":"He got back home.","wordIds":["w:他","w:回到","w:家里","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:137","zh":"他给我打电话了。","pinyin":"Tā gěi wǒ dǎ diànhuà le.","en":"He called me.","wordIds":["w:他","w:给","w:我","w:打电话","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l3:222","zh":"他忙起来就忘了吃饭。","pinyin":"Tā máng qǐlái jiù wàng le chīfàn.","en":"When he gets busy, he forgets to eat.","wordIds":["w:他","w:忙","w:起来","w:就","w:忘","w:了","w:吃饭"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:170","zh":"他干什么了？","pinyin":"Tā gànshénme le?","en":"What did he do?","wordIds":["w:他","w:干什么","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:215","zh":"他坐下了。","pinyin":"Tā zuòxia le.","en":"He sat down.","wordIds":["w:他","w:坐下","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l2:338","zh":"你去过北京吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ qù guo Běijīng ma?","en":"Have you been to Beijing?","wordIds":["w:你","w:去","w:过","w:北京","w:吗"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:210","zh":"你看一下儿。","pinyin":"Nǐ kàn yíxiàr.","en":"Take a quick look.","wordIds":["w:你","w:看","w:一下儿"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:211","zh":"我说一下儿。","pinyin":"Wǒ shuō yíxiàr.","en":"Let me say a bit.","wordIds":["w:我","w:说","w:一下儿"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:217","zh":"他学了半年。","pinyin":"Tā xuéle bànnián.","en":"He studied for half a year.","wordIds":["w:他","w:学","w:了","w:半年"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:090","zh":"朋友们都来了。","pinyin":"Péngyoumen dōu lái le.","en":"The friends all came.","wordIds":["w:朋友","w:们","w:都","w:来","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:206","zh":"前天他没来，后天他能来。","pinyin":"Qiántiān tā méi lái, hòutiān tā néng lái.","en":"He didn't come the day before yesterday, but he can come the day after tomorrow.","wordIds":["w:前天","w:他","w:没","w:来","w:后天","w:他","w:能","w:来"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:086","zh":"他正在喝水。","pinyin":"Tā zhèngzài hē shuǐ.","en":"He's drinking water.","wordIds":["w:他","w:正在","w:喝","w:水"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:038","zh":"这个太大了。","pinyin":"Zhège tài dà le.","en":"This one is too big.","wordIds":["w:这","w:个","w:太","w:大","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:148","zh":"对不起，我来晚了。","pinyin":"Duìbuqǐ, wǒ lái wǎn le.","en":"Sorry, I'm late.","wordIds":["w:对不起","w:我","w:来","w:晚","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:203","zh":"前天我没去。","pinyin":"Qiántiān wǒ méi qù.","en":"I didn't go the day before yesterday.","wordIds":["w:前天","w:我","w:没","w:去"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l3:220","zh":"天气冷起来了。","pinyin":"Tiānqì lěng qǐlái le.","en":"The weather started getting cold.","wordIds":["w:天气","w:冷","w:起来","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:037","zh":"太好了！","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le!","en":"That's wonderful!","wordIds":["w:太","w:好","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:023","zh":"我们没做。","pinyin":"Wǒmen méi zuò.","en":"We didn't do it.","wordIds":["w:我们","w:没","w:做"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:040","zh":"我们太多了。","pinyin":"Wǒmen tài duō le.","en":"There are too many of us.","wordIds":["w:我们","w:太","w:多","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:065","zh":"别说了。","pinyin":"Bié shuō le.","en":"Stop talking.","wordIds":["w:别","w:说","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:131","zh":"不用了，谢谢。","pinyin":"Búyòng le, xièxie.","en":"No need, thanks.","wordIds":["w:不用","w:了","w:谢谢"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:227","zh":"别开玩笑了。","pinyin":"Bié kāiwánxiào le.","en":"Stop joking.","wordIds":["w:别","w:开玩笑","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l1:147","zh":"没什么。","pinyin":"Méi shénme.","en":"It's nothing.","wordIds":["w:没","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l3:135","zh":"太晚了，我们去不了了。","pinyin":"Tài wǎn le, wǒmen qù bu liǎo le.","en":"It's too late, we can't go anymore.","wordIds":["w:太","w:晚","w:了","w:我们","w:去","w:不","w:了","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u38"},{"id":"s:l2:339","zh":"我没吃过这个菜。","pinyin":"Wǒ méi chī guo zhège cài.","en":"I haven't tried this dish before.","wordIds":["w:我","w:没","w:吃","w:过","w:这","w:个","w:菜"],"unitId":"l1-u38"}]}
